        {
          "text": "Mana Beleshazari yalaka abandu, nibafwala Danieli tsingubo tsieisambarau, nibara omunyolo kweitsahaabu mwikosilie, nibakhupa omulome khukeke, mbu abe owakhataru muburuchi.",
